<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-002" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:wenjiao" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:wenjiao:m0000" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">温嶠</persName>初爲<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:wenjiao:m0004" ref="b21_e55_8bd">劉琨</persName>使來過江。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:wangchengxiang" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">既詣<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:wangchengxiang:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">王丞相</persName>，陳主上幽越，社稷焚滅，山陵夷毀之酷，有黍離之痛。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:jiangzuo" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">既出，懽然言曰：「江左自有<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:jiangzuo:m0013" ref="h1v_8ap_b9y">管夷吾</persName>，此復何憂？」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:guan" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:guan:m0000" ref="h1v_8ap_b9y">管仲</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-wangdao-relatives:guan:m0002" ref="h1v_8ap_b9y">夷吾</persName>者，潁上人。</p>
</text>
